+ O1  FOB  = first evaluation with >= 1 TAIL over-bar episode (first tail over-bar episode).  PRIMARY outcome.
+ O2  ANY alarm  = first evaluation that is the second of two consecutive ANY-flagged evaluations; ANY flag = >= 5
+     episodes over the bar (if an evaluation holds n != 10 episodes: >= ceil(n/2); n reported).
+ O3  TAIL alarm = the same with TAIL over-bar episodes.
+ O4  PARK = first evaluation with CMD_L >= 0.60.  (RAIL, CMD_L >= 0.90, and first ANY / TAIL flags also reported.)
